msgstr "包含 :obj:`~.FeedMoreResp.feeds` 列表和 :obj:`~.FeedMoreResp.aux` 信息的已验证类型化响应。"

#: aioqzone.api.web.model.QzoneWebAPI.feeds3_html_more:10 of
